    <briefdescription>
<para>Translates SDL events into engine events and dispatches them via <ref refid="classEventBus" kindref="compound">EventBus</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class is responsible for converting low-level SDL events (SDL_Event) into engine-specific event objects and dispatching them to the <ref refid="classEventBus" kindref="compound">EventBus</ref>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>All methods are static; this class is not meant to be instantiated. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
